        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.18.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Job 18:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NAM.2.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nah 2:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo busyu bwamwami bwakausana, miyeeyo yakwe yakamuyoosya, manungilo aatusolo twakwe akatontola, amazwi aakwe akali kugontana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.47.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 47:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.6.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 6:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mwami wakoongolola canguzu, walailila kuti kuletwe basondi, ba-Kasidi abaŋanga. Nkabela mwami wakaambila basongo baku-Babuloni kuti, Kufumbwa muntu uubala malembo aya akupandulula mbwaamba, uyoosamikwa zisani zisalala pyu akubikilwa luwenje lwangolida munsingo yakwe, alimwi uyooba mweendelezi watatu wamucisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.41.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Matl 41:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo kwakanjila basongo boonse bamwami, pele bakakacilwa kubala malembo akupandulwida mwami mbwaamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mwami Belisazara wakayoowa loko, abusyu bwakwe bwakausana, abalo basilutwe bakwe bakagamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
